    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623490/extras/18e175507b1ba3fd012389388c8246ae.poster.avif?t=1755449342\" width=480 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623490/extras/18e175507b1ba3fd012389388c8246ae.webm?t=1755449342\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623490/extras/18e175507b1ba3fd012389388c8246ae.mp4?t=1755449342\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You are a Button</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Imagine  the buttons popped out of your controllers and  leapt right into the screen. That's the unique concept behind <strong>One More Button</strong>. You play as the  circle button. To move around, you'll press the arrow buttons scattered around the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623490/extras/627f4f9a840c7bc2426f5fe31a44ee7f.poster.avif?t=1755449342\" width=480 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623490/extras/627f4f9a840c7bc2426f5fe31a44ee7f.webm?t=1755449342\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623490/extras/627f4f9a840c7bc2426f5fe31a44ee7f.mp4?t=1755449342\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Brain-Melting Puzzles</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push, press, and twist your way to the goal!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Need to take a step back? The <strong>redo</strong> and <strong>undo</strong> buttons make retrying easy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623490/extras/565f24846d7761304b0fcf6c52841390.poster.avif?t=1755449342\" width=480 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623490/extras/565f24846d7761304b0fcf6c52841390.webm?t=1755449342\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623490/extras/565f24846d7761304b0fcf6c52841390.mp4?t=1755449342\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>In a Beautiful Hand Drawn World</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a variety of mysterious worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each packed with unique gimmicks and mechanics</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623490/extras/625cd3b83230a47e62869d839a9acfbd.poster.avif?t=1755449342\" width=480 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623490/extras/625cd3b83230a47e62869d839a9acfbd.webm?t=1755449342\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623490/extras/625cd3b83230a47e62869d839a9acfbd.mp4?t=1755449342\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623490/extras/18e175507b1ba3fd012389388c8246ae.poster.avif?t=1755449342\" width=480 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623490/extras/18e175507b1ba3fd012389388c8246ae.webm?t=1755449342\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623490/extras/18e175507b1ba3fd012389388c8246ae.mp4?t=1755449342\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You are a Button</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Imagine  the buttons popped out of your controllers and  leapt right into the screen. That's the unique concept behind <strong>One More Button</strong>. You play as the  circle button. To move around, you'll press the arrow buttons scattered around the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623490/extras/627f4f9a840c7bc2426f5fe31a44ee7f.poster.avif?t=1755449342\" width=480 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623490/extras/627f4f9a840c7bc2426f5fe31a44ee7f.webm?t=1755449342\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623490/extras/627f4f9a840c7bc2426f5fe31a44ee7f.mp4?t=1755449342\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Brain-Melting Puzzles</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push, press, and twist your way to the goal!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Need to take a step back? The <strong>redo</strong> and <strong>undo</strong> buttons make retrying easy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623490/extras/565f24846d7761304b0fcf6c52841390.poster.avif?t=1755449342\" width=480 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623490/extras/565f24846d7761304b0fcf6c52841390.webm?t=1755449342\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623490/extras/565f24846d7761304b0fcf6c52841390.mp4?t=1755449342\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>In a Beautiful Hand Drawn World</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a variety of mysterious worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each packed with unique gimmicks and mechanics</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623490/extras/625cd3b83230a47e62869d839a9acfbd.poster.avif?t=1755449342\" width=480 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623490/extras/625cd3b83230a47e62869d839a9acfbd.webm?t=1755449342\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623490/extras/625cd3b83230a47e62869d839a9acfbd.mp4?t=1755449342\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
